@set health = 10
A goblin jumps out at you! Your health is {{health}}.

[[Fight it]](fight)

[[fight]]:
@dec health 4
The goblin hits you. Your health is {{health}}.

{{#if health <= 0}}{{goto "dead"}}{{else}}[[Keep fighting]](fight), or [[run away]](escape).{{/if}}

[[dead]]:
@end
You fall to the ground, and everything goes dark.

[[escape]]:
@end
You get away, with {{health}} health left.
